# WP22-REST (83688f54f): several runtime grids (Main 25 m, Foliage 12.8 m, LandscapeTiles 50 m), each with its HLOD
# layer; the Player source (9000001, TargetGrids Main+Foliage, Scripts/World/WPWalk.lua walks 200 m along +X).
# The Play view: Camera 1003 (inside the Player cube at the origin) is switched off for this run, so Play from Here
# (after the paint: Load All refuses while an entity is edited) looks through the editor camera placed 250 m above, 150 m behind the Player. The world is frozen: the paint step does NOT save (Load All = the panel button at window point 237,166).
# WP_Protocol_HLOD/ is a build product (not in git): the first step builds it (the reply waits for the bake).
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Когда run Foliage "Foliage mode"
Когда run Foliage "Add mesh to the palette: boulder_01"
Когда input click - 237,166
Тогда wp22_loaded World Partition (Edit): Load All загрузил ячейки с диска - «Loaded in the editor» больше 0, во вьюпорте застройка
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 1000,6000,1000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.2,-1,0.15
Когда run Foliage "Tool: Paint"
Когда run Foliage "Stroke at viewport centre"
Тогда wp22_paint экземпляры boulder_01 легли под центром вьюпорта (в палитре число экземпляров больше 0), в ячейки грида Foliage; шов не виден
Когда set 1003 Camera.AutoActivateForPlayer false
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -15000,25000,-15000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 1,-0.55,0.55
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 1
Тогда wp22_grids три грида разными цветами; загружены только ячейки Main и Foliage вокруг игрока (200 м по +X); LandscapeTiles вдали — HLOD своего слоя, без дыры на стыке
Когда run Action "Stop"
